Changes made with respect to the original RINE implementation include:
replacing the frozen CLIP:ViT-L/14 backbone with DINOv2, extending the
classification head from binary to three-class output, adding a DPT-style
segmentation branch over the backbone's patch tokens, and restructuring data
loading, configuration and logging.

